Testimonial Coordinator & Mental Health Counselor — Swann Pichon
Research & Consulting — Nora Doukkali Elamajidi
Gynaecological Advisor — Dr. Caroline Bensky
Midwife Advisor — Caterina Montagnoli

Video
Chapters 1 & 3 — Maevia Griffiths
Chapter 2 — [pendiente]

Trailer — Rio Bravo Trailers
Marketing Consulting — Lucía Quijano
─────────────────────
This project has been funded by the HES-SO Innovation Grant and developed at HEAD – Genève, with the invaluable collaboration of:
Research Director — Anthony Masure
Secretary of the Research Direction — Christelle Granite-Nobles

And the partnership of HEdS (Haute École de Santé)
